 |\n| FlexGen-fused(w/ zipserv)      |\n| C.A.O(w/ zipserv)              |\n| C.A.O-fused(w/ zipserv)        |\n| C.A.O-fused(w/ zipserv)-kvcomp |\n| C.A.O-fused(w/ p4flat)         |\n| C.A.O-fused(w/ p4flat)-kvcomp  |\n\n그러니까 기존 위 시스템에 cao-fused(w/ cd3), cao-fused(w/ cd3)-kvcomp 두개가 추가되는거지\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05c94-62be-76c2-a334-4307cc828710","create_time":1788259623.6361191,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05c94-92cc-7f82-a3c3-cd871e35fd68","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"명령어 알려줘\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05c94-92b9-7be1-a073-baa19081a766","create_time":1788259635.9169364,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05c95-249f-71e3-b40c-c0b5a02a2817","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"offline은 block 고정 안하지 않아? 지금 말하는건 offline 실험이라니까? 제발 문맥을 잃지마\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05c95-248b-79a1-bb93-a73280c92944","create_time":1788259673.2476666,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05c97-6e6b-79b0-b4e3-d829e67aff2d","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"repeat는 1번만 해도 큰 문제 없을 거라는게 내 생각인데 어때?\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05c97-6e53-71f0-bdb0-ce89693033f6","create_time":1788259823.211441,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05d25-24f9-7b50-b2ca-0f11f6a5116e","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"아까 serving suite에 breakdown 실험에서 결과에 gpu fwd나 stall 등등 여러 측정 값 잘 나오는거 확인했지?\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a05d25-2430-7772-8379-5da9ec1b9c44","create_time":1788269110.521562,"content_item_kinds":["user.text"]}},{"type":"message","id":"msg_01a05d26-9fad-7e30-86c9-1f77eec3c3ec","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"```css\nscripts/serving/run_performance_suite.sh \\\n    --codecs p4flat,cd3